I am curious as to how CODEX handles large targets with multiple genes? In this situation can we enter our data with multiple lines per target for each gene or will we need to merge these values into one line per target?

i.e:

1 10752 66487 DDX11L1
1 10752 66487 WASH7P
1 10752 66487 MIR1302-11
1 10752 66487 FAM138A

Does CODEX require gene names for the 4th column or is this value interchangeable with ENSEMBL IDs, Uniprot IDs, etc.?

