Hi,

You are right in that almost all kb targets got filtered out due to extreme coverage. I think there must be something that you miss here. If I understand correctly, you are using targeted sequencing. For targeted sequencing, you can have 2855244 targets that are each 1kb long? Another reason can be the threshold for your QC step, which is specified by the cov_thresh argument in the qc() function. It has a lower and an upper bound. The upper bound might not be high enough.

Yuchao

